Package: rray
Title: Array Helpers
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Davis", "Vaughan", , "davis@posit.co", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ROR = "03wc8by49"))
  )
Description: Broadcast, reshape, reduce, and index base R arrays.
    Broadcasting repeats axes with a dimension of one so that arrays with
    different dimensions can be flexibly combined. Every function
    broadcasts its inputs, so operations such as arithmetic, comparison,
    and combining work consistently across axes.
